            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 520,
                "endIndex": 798,
                "text": "In the Japanese expansion **MEGA 拡張パック「30th CELEBRATION」 (Set code: `M6a`)**, cards **017/103 through 046/103** comprise 30 consecutive Pikachu cards, each featuring distinct illustration artwork created by 30 different artists from throughout Pokémon TCG history"
