                "endIndex": 2293,
                "text": "**Absence from `pokemon-card.com` Public Database:** Secret Rares (cards numbered higher than 103/103, including AR 104–123, SAR 124–133, and the secret unnumbered `RGB` Mew variants) are omitted from the public card directory at `pokemon-card.com/card-search/`"
